OL,3,GNEWSAStevie Wonder leaves cafe staff
OL,4,A#1,000 tip
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a Greater Manchester cafe
OL,7,Ffound themselves sharing a #1,000 tip
OL,8,Fafter a late-night visit from a musical
OL,9,Flegend.
OL,11,FCafe Continental in Stalybridge found
OL,12,Fitself feeding Stevie Wonder, his band
OL,13,Fand entourage after the singer's
OL,14,Fsold-out gig performing his classic
OL,15,Falbum Songs In The Key Of Life at the
OL,16,FCo-op Live in Manchester.
OL,18,FOwner Ryan Robinson said Wonder, 76,
OL,19,Fwas "a really nice guy, happy to chat
OL,20,Fto everybody".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
